  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Rural Producers in Commercial Agriculture (EPIC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EPIC aims to empower rural producers and their wider communities to influence public decisions and private sector conduct in favour of bottom-up, locally beneficial and more sustainable investments in commercial agriculture</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence and guidance will inform the action of governments, grassroots organisations, businesses, impact investors, DFIs and development agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective: To&#xa0;empower communities to&#xa0;influence public decisions and private sector conduct in favour of bottom-up, locally beneficial and more sustainable investments in&#xa0;commercial&#xa0;agriculture.&#xa0; Outcomes:&#xa0;1. Improved evidence, insight&#xa0;and guidance on how to&#xa0;empower communities for&#xa0;bottom-up, locally beneficial and&#xa0;more&#xa0;sustainable investments in&#xa0;commercial&#xa0;agriculture;&#xa0;2. In two low&#xa0;or&#xa0;middle-income countries, communities&#xa0;empowered&#xa0;to make informed choices, exercise rights and where relevant develop equitable partnerships with the private sector;&#xa0;3. Lessons&#xa0;shared&#xa0;and alliances built for&#xa0;mainstreaming&#xa0;community empowerment in the policy and practice of&#xa0;agribusiness&#xa0;investments&#xa0;in&#xa0;the target&#xa0;countries and internationally.</narrative>
  </description>
